1
00:00:14,798 --> 00:00:18,627
Oh, P’Gun, you’re here already?

2
00:00:18,627 --> 00:00:23,294
Uh—do you two know each other?

3
00:00:23,294 --> 00:00:26,010
I’m Kongkwan. I’m your fiancée.

4
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:27,357
We met when we were kids.

5
00:00:27,357 --> 00:00:30,560
Oh… oh.

6
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:36,507
Childhood fiancée, huh?

7
00:00:38,534 --> 00:00:42,559
- Ah… yes.
- Your mom’s inside.

8
00:00:42,559 --> 00:00:43,640
Alright.

9
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:53,719
Oh—sorry! Sorry!

10
00:00:53,719 --> 00:00:58,120
I’ll pick it up myself.
Sorry, sorry.

11
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:04,247
- You’re bleeding.
- It’s okay, P’Gun. Just a scratch.

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,520
P’Gun—hey, why…

13
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:16,840
- Earth’s bleeding!
- What?

14
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:23,600
- It’s fine. I’m going in to see my mom first, okay?
- Earth.

15
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:30,280
I’ll excuse myself.
Earth.
